n style=\"height:6px\"></span><span style=\"height:4px\"></span>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"status\">Ready</div>\n\n      <div class=\"button cancel\" aria-label=\"Clear text\">\n        <svg viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M3 3l10 10M13 3L3 13\" /></svg>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"button primary\" aria-label=\"Start dictation\">\n        <svg viewBox=\"0 0 18 18\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n          <rect x=\"6\" y=\"2\" width=\"6\" height=\"9\" rx=\"3\" />\n          <path d=\"M3.5 8.5a5.5 5.5 0 0 0 11 0M9 14v2M6 16h6\" />\n        </svg>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n  </main>\n</body>\n</html>\n"},"/Users/zenray/Create/Build/Productions/GithubProductions/ZenRayDictate/README.md":{"type":"update","unified_diff":"@@ -1,2 +1,8 @@\n-# ZenRay Dictate\n+# ZenRay Dictate V2\n+\n+V2 released on 2026-09-12. The caret and `Ask anything` placeholder now share the same TextKit line geometry, so the insertion bar is aligned with the text from the first frame.\n+\n+![ZenRay Dictate V2 component](docs/v2-component.jpg)\n+\n+[Read the complete V2 patch notes](docs/patch-notes-v2.md).\n \n","move_path":null}},"status":"completed","stdout":"Success. Updated the following files:\nA /Users/zenray/Create/Build/Productions/GithubProductions/ZenRayDictate/docs/v2-component.html\nA /Users/zenray/Create/Build/Productions/GithubProductions/ZenRayDictate/docs/patch-notes-v2.md\nM /Users/zenray/Create/Build/Productions/GithubProductions/ZenRayDictate/build.sh\nM /Users/zenray/Create/Build/Productions/GithubProductions/ZenRayDictate/Scripts/verify-independent-composer.sh\nM /Users/zenray/Create/Build/Productions/GithubProductions/ZenRayDictate/README.md\n","stderr":""},"started_at_ms":1789202608457,"completed_at_ms":1789202608458}}
